#: d7f4b1e425be499086022419c77786a8 ed9c33af53954a70b00e8ad75ee171cb
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:40
#: 063dc2938f284af8a6403b8e2ba0fc9f 10f504433e6240a1bc1a694ed2c98149
#: 221ca68fcd6c40e58ec61e56b9090702 310f9cc83f1a4a54b89e88a5d84ab4cd
#: 540a462d8e264d1e91eb8fe8dc8e1dec f8a083ae0db0448a83b34de3b93f7ee9
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:42
#: 1d43893e5dc840f0912f5ba6fb040884 60d3ab64b8db4dde9e484270f6392134
#: 6435302252b143d09590f241cd91be42 6d7d2c75625541dfab56faad3a075d5f
#: 75c2d59f31c64879ba0129acf8212ea4 c87f3c1d95bd4e9bacd9f50edec93d0f
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART3) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL6（UART3））进行接收机连接。以下为使用 "
"Serial6 的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:44
#: 34321c6939a647dfb73480d735da3aa1 4c9fa89b482f4f50abe486f7b4c368ce
#: 71155bf4b3b84d5baf547ee00b28fc71 a1f0e097179249508409cfd9016c3646
#: b80a5f3d39b0463ebdacee338ef75930 c2f03cdce49f461295f99816da065430
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:46
#: 4baeb4e7ad254164bdde12f15b854c81 5fc4189c359b48569400d308ce1c8ce9
#: 71d90f406f2a43b7ad48e6ef67187ce1 a65997810ac449e5b61383195426df79
#: d1cc67aa3d324fb9944192997ca5d9e3 f49d342bdaf74a37b572caad47097b3e
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:48
#: 08dfaf375c3c4b77aa5d4b46bbebccdf 121f7cd9fd7840039449e0f103085294
#: 40fef93d1dd440e5ae7ee9f1052433e0 6a6349309e23474f8be74902a69b375b
#: 78ce0c72906a4b3395a6485e5a1050b2 a2c24c201e1347508ff80da5e1f5b3fe
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:50
#: 342cbd8a28d14d078f89cde1bdcd160c 3cdb267972014ce1a1b52642ae5c0d92
#: 4be792b5eb8b4f6a83460c653d8d2d34 54f2811eddcc41ad9dd9fcc0c4965410
#: 9308bc28411645668238cdc9ce1d7cbc af8f7591d3e446a2acd0320268d31741
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:52
#: 08b8ae1c45834ae0a369bd339c9fb291 46896a8dddc74574b36d2ce8260fad6c
#: 7767e088e35948b7b3f8d5e59ea1c8aa 8b2d6e8971ea49ce88b0b2b2cecdd14f
#: aa456a4b466248d48b046e534a702284 e37c4249343c408c89609f5d19bcb5fb
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:55
#: 0c6a2456417c4b46897fbcb6339b0862 4a41f091e8ea4121bb2a54b04389a9e0
#: 5bf12298e9414fc289556fd2ed1a8d20 8581fd0dc79c4b2c8db109f2b3dc7c0b
